Error [E3403]: `Clock formatting` is non-deterministic and cannot appear in a pure evaluation.
  --> pure_code_rejects_clock_provenance_laundered_through_a_struct_6.jet:6:21
    |
  6 |     return "{holder.clock} {holder.clock:Debug}"
    |                     ^^^^^
 Why: Pure evaluation must produce the same result on every machine (D-PURE2).
 Fix: Remove this call, or remove the enclosing function's explicit empty effect bound.
 Denial: pure
 Call chain: Clock formatting
